@crew v-yarrow-ulla
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Courier. Don't ask about the case. Nobody tells me either.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Mm, {me}. Slept with the case again. It snores.   #funny
?

== chat
- Three ships this month. The Wren's got the best toast.
- The crew store sells good sweets. That's the only thing I'm taking home.

== near
? habit:stargazer
- Observatory. Quiet, dark, nobody asking about the case. Perfect.
? habit:shopper
- Window shopping. My case is full. Of what, I couldn't say.   #funny
?

== bye
- {bye}. If anyone asks, you didn't see a case.   #funny

== smalltalk
- It's just a case.
- Toast. Good toast.
